---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="kidthales"
  subtitle="Independent Software Architect & Systems Craftsman"
  description="Personal site and open-source portfolio for kidthales: accessible design systems, headless devops toolchains, and high-integrity software engineering."
>
  <section class="hero-overview">
    <p class="lead-text">
      I engineer high-integrity desktop applications, accessible design systems, and headless devops toolchains. My work emphasizes local-first data sovereignty, minimal runtime overhead, and mathematically verified accessibility.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta-row">
      <a href="/projects/" role="button">Explore Projects</a>
      <a href="/tools/" role="button" class="secondary">Interactive Tools</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/kidthales"
        role="button"
        class="secondary"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        GitHub Profile
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="domains-overview">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <h2>Focus Areas & Open Source</h2>
      <p>Core engineering domains and active software initiatives.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="domain-card">
        <header>
          <h3>Accessible UI & Design Systems</h3>
        </header>
        <p>
          Ultra-minified, standards-compliant CSS frameworks and code generators built strictly on scientifically calibrated, colorblind-safe color schemes.
        </p>
        <ul class="domain-highlights">
          <li>
            <a href="/projects/picotol/"><strong>@kidthales/picotol</strong></a>: Pure-CSS semantic HTML framework under 10 KB with full WCAG 2.2 AA/AAA certification across light and dark modes.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/projects/tol-palettes/"><strong>@kidthales/tol-palettes</strong></a>: 22 schema-validated color schemes with multi-environment generators for CSS, TypeScript, Python, Godot 4, and Aseprite.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <footer>
          <a href="/projects/" role="button" class="secondary">View Design Systems</a>
        </footer>
      </article>

      <article class="domain-card">
        <header>
          <h3>DevOps & Game Asset Toolchains</h3>
        </header>
        <p>
          Headless, containerized asset-processing toolchains and multi-architecture compilation pipelines designed for automated CI/CD workflows.
        </p>
        <ul class="domain-highlights">
          <li>
            <a href="/projects/docker-game-development-toolkit/"><strong>Docker Game Dev Toolkit</strong></a>: Multi-arch OCI image bundling Tiled 1.12, tile-extruder, and YAML transforms for seamless CI pipelines.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/projects/docker-aseprite-headless/"><strong>Docker Aseprite Headless</strong></a>: Immutable OCI builder compiling headless Aseprite on Ubuntu 24.04 LTS across amd64 and arm64.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <footer>
          <a href="/projects/" role="button" class="secondary">View DevOps Toolchains</a>
        </footer>
      </article>

      <article class="domain-card">
        <header>
          <h3>Interactive Tools & Ecosystem</h3>
        </header>
        <p>
          Lightweight deterministic browser applications, algorithmic generators, and game engine extension libraries.
        </p>
        <ul class="domain-highlights">
          <li>
            <a href="/tools/spiderex/"><strong>Spiderex</strong></a>: Daily guitar fingering drill engine powered by a deterministic calendar-seeded PRNG and ASCII tablature generator.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/pgmmv/"><strong>PGMMV Plugin Suite</strong></a>: Battle-tested gameplay plugins (collisions, coordinates, tile snapping, storage) and complete TypeScript definitions.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <footer>
          <a href="/tools/" role="button" class="secondary">Launch Tools</a>
        </footer>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero-overview {
    margin-block-end: 3.5rem;
    padding-block-end: 2rem;
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--pt-border-color);
  }

  .lead-text {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-block-end: 1.75rem;
  }

  .hero-cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .domains-overview {
    margin-block-end: 3rem;
  }

  .section-heading {
    margin-block-end: 1.75rem;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin-block-end: 0.25rem;
  }

  .section-heading p {
    color: var(--pt-muted-color);
  }

  .domain-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-block-end: 1.5rem;
  }

  .domain-card h3 {
    margin-block-end: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .domain-highlights {
    padding-inline-start: 1.25rem;
    margin-block: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .domain-highlights li {
    margin-block-end: 0.5rem;
  }

  .domain-card footer {
    margin-block-start: 1rem;
  }
</style>
